docs {
  # Send Test Webhook
  
  Queues a signed outbound `ping` to the configured project webhook URL.
  
  **Method:** POST  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/settings/project/integrations/webhook-test`  
  **Route name:** `project.integrations.webhook-test`  
  **Permission:** `CanManageProjectSettings`
  
  Prerequisites (Integrations settings):
  
  1. `webhook_url` set
  2. `webhook_secret` configured
  3. Queue worker running (`php artisan queue:work` / Horizon)
  
  Flash error if URL/secret missing; success flash when queued.
  
  Inspect delivery on webhook.site / your receiver, or practice HMAC with **PublicApi → Webhooks → Verify Webhook Signature**.
  
  Deprecated alias (same action): `POST /settings/project/webhook-test` — see **Send Test Webhook Deprecated Alias**.
}
